; Two diagnostics, both the union's. Neither `number_above_max` /
; `not_cross_ref` (for the vector) nor `not_member` / `not_cross_ref` (for
; the misspelled member) is emitted: no arm was determined, so no arm's
; private cause is forwarded.
(diagnostics
  (diagnostic :code union_no_branch_matched :path [use q])
  (diagnostic :code union_no_branch_matched :path [use m]))
